00:06:28.921 --> 00:06:31.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I really --
for me, it was a disaster.

00:06:31.157 --> 00:06:34.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the two-hour carpet ende
and I remember kind of

00:06:34.127 --> 00:06:36.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
