00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:42.168 line:92%
I just don't have it in me."

00:06:42.168 --> 00:06:45.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am not Ryan Seacrest.
-You --

00:06:45.071 --> 00:06:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously, a big week
