00:06:49.509 --> 00:06:52.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it today?
-Yeah.

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:55.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is -- You know,
it's situations like these

00:06:55.014 --> 00:06:56.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
