00:07:39.892 --> 00:07:44.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know,
it's been a very nice day.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it was
an incredible show.

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:48.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was such a great show
about family.

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:52.638
It was even cooler that ther
